<http://data.silknow.org/object/60edb00d-6863-30a0-8007-db97fede3dee>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Man’s sword hangers and front strap of leather, lined with tawny silk velvet. They are embroidered with silver filé, purl and spangles in a pattern of abstract leaves. The hangers are in 3 parts, each with 3 scabbard straps held with metal buckles. The hangers are attached at the top with a metal hook. The front strap is sewn to the outside scabbard strap and has a hook at the other end."@en , "Man's sword hangers, 1600-24, English; leather, silver embroidery, lined with tawny silk velvet"@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/b5cdb6ef-364d-358f-bfc9-e1089f635a70> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/8873afa6-fa6d-36a5-bc63-374a46ba68b4> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/0e1a14b5-335a-3913-b3c8-0a7fa437a605> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/34c9407c-642b-3298-9115-4c3e3b03d608> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Man's sword hangers, 1600-24, English; leather, silver embroidery, lined with tawny silk velvet"@en , "Man’s sword hangers and front strap of leather, lined with tawny silk velvet. They are embroidered with silver filé, purl and spangles in a pattern of abstract leaves. The hangers are in 3 parts, each with 3 scabbard straps held with metal buckles. The hangers are attached at the top with a metal hook. The front strap is sewn to the outside scabbard strap and has a hook at the other end."@en ;
        ecrm:P43_has_dimension         <http://data.silknow.org/object/60edb00d-6863-30a0-8007-db97fede3dee/dimension/2> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/60edb00d-6863-30a0-8007-db97fede3dee/dimension/1> ;
